'''WOPA Esport''' (currently known as '''STATE Esport''' for sponsorship reasons) is a [[:Category:Denmark|Danish]] esports organization owned by Danish professional footballer [[:wikipedia:Simon_Kjær|Simon Kjær]].

==Timeline==
{{Tabs dynamic
|name1=2024
|name2=2025
|name3=2026
|This=3

|content1=
* April 15th - '''WOPA Esport''' enter ''Counter-Strike 2'' by acquiring the core of [[Alpha Gaming]]'s roster, consisting of [[Gnøffe]], [[Leakz]], [[LUMSEN]], [[brzer]] and [[addi]], with the latter joining as coach. Additionally, [[Vster]] is signed to complete the lineup. <ref name="WOPA CS2">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/WopaEsport/status/1779850912611357022|title=ROSTER|date=2024-04-15|author='''WOPA Esport'''}}</ref>
* May 31st - '''WOPA Esport''' part ways with [[addi]]. <ref name="-addi">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/addiiCS2/status/1796558744475807760|title=Today is my last day in @WopaEsport and I just want to thank all the players for these 5 months together its been a pleasure to work with them!|date=2024-05-31|author=[[addi]]}}</ref>
* June 18th - '''WOPA Esport''' bench [[LUMSEN]]. <ref name="LUMSEN bench">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/WopaEsport/status/1803011657553105248|title=Det er imod alles ønske, men desværre stepper LUMSEN ned fra WOPAs main hold per dd|language={{Flag|dk}} Danish|trans_title=It is against everyone's wish, but unfortunately LUMSEN is stepping down from WOPA's main team as of today|date=2024-06-18|author='''WOPA Esport'''}}</ref>
* June 26th - '''WOPA Esport''' bench [[brzer]]. <ref name="brzer bench">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/WopaEsport/status/1805995730814775440|title=It has been a difficult decision, but together with @brzer3 we have come to a mutual agreed that he will step down from WOPA's main team as of today|date=2024-06-26|author='''WOPA Esport'''}}</ref>
* July 9th - '''WOPA Esport''' acquire [[zEden]] from [[9INE Academy]]. <ref name="+zEden">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/WopaEsport/status/1810675144999764136|title=We are happy to announce that we have come to an agreement with @9INEGG regarding the transfer of @zEdencs|date=2024-07-09|author='''WOPA Esport'''}}</ref>
* July 19th - [[LUMSEN]] is acquired by [[Linx Legacy Esport]]. <ref name="-LUMSEN">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/LinxLegacyGG/status/1814359552072016299|title=The last player!|date=2024-07-19|author=[[Linx Legacy Esport]]}}</ref>
* September 6th - '''WOPA Esport''' bench [[zEden]]. <ref name="zEden bench">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/WopaEsport/status/1832029732483022919|title=After careful consideration @zEdencs has been benched from the active roster|date=2024-09-06|author='''WOPA Esport'''}}</ref>
* September 12th - '''WOPA Esport''' sign [[sL1m3]] and [[PR1mE]]. <ref name="+sL1m3 +Pr1mE">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/WopaEsport/status/1834306007800938583|title=WOPA MAIN UPDATE|date=2024-09-12|author='''WOPA Esport'''}}</ref>
* September 13th - '''WOPA Esport''' sign [[pHENOMENON]] as their new coach. <ref name="+pHENOMENON">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/WopaEsport/status/1834547321012379840|title=and we also got a new coach for our main team|date=2024-09-13|author='''WOPA Esport'''}}</ref>
* October 17th - [[brzer]] is acquired by [[Hedensted X SERA]]. <ref name="-brzer">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/SERA_ESPORT/status/1846977689061585089|title=Something new from Sera in the playerbreak|date=2024-10-17|author=[[SERA Esport]]}}</ref>
* October 18th - [[zEden]] is acquired by [[SERA Esport]]. <ref name="-zEden">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/SERA_ESPORT/status/1847304977930154426|title=Things are about to change|date=2024-10-18|author=[[SERA Esport]]}}</ref>

|content2=
* January 23rd - '''WOPA Esport''' part ways with [[Leakz]]. <ref name="-leakz">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/WopaEsport/status/1882480433620803637|title=Farewell @LeakzCSGO|date=2025-01-23|author='''WOPA Esport'''}}</ref>
* January 24th - '''WOPA Esport''' part ways with [[pHENOMENON]]. <ref name="-phenomenon">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/wopaesport/status/1882909538761998744|title=Another update from the club|date=2025-01-24|author='''WOPA Esport'''}}</ref>
*January 27th - '''WOPA Esport''' acquire [[n1Xen]] from [[ECSTATIC]]. <ref name="+n1Xen">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/wopaesport/status/1883925833238339674|title=How is it even possible to replace a @Dust2dk POWER Liga MVP such as @LeakzCSGO?|date=2025-01-27|author='''WOPA Esport'''}}</ref>
*May 7th - '''WOPA Esport''' sign [[b0ychild]] as coach. <ref name="+b0ychild">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/wopaesport/status/1920067568380830014|title=Sidste brik er lagt|language={{Flag|dk}} Danish|trans_title=The last piece has been placed|date=2025-05-07|author='''WOPA Esport'''}}</ref>
*June 9th - [[n1Xen]] is acquired by an undisclosed organization, later revealed to be [[Copenhagen_Wolves_(American_organization)|Copenhagen Wolves]]. <ref name="-n1xen">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/WopaEsport/status/1932158287472197827|title=Friend of the future Danish King and amazing CS2 talent @n1Xen7 has been sold tonight|date=2025-06-09|author='''WOPA Esports'''}}</ref>
*June 30th - '''WOPA Esport''' part ways with [[Gnøffe]], [[Vster]], [[sL1m3]], and [[PR1mE]]. <ref name="-players">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/WopaEsport/status/1939768379608375664|title=A Farewell to @sL1m3CS, @GnoffeCSGO, @PR1mECS, and @VsterCS2|date=2025-06-30|author='''WOPA Esport'''}}</ref>
*July 1st - '''WOPA Esport''' announce their new lineup with the signings of [[Zanto]] and [[GA1De]], the acquisition of [[Skejs]] from [[XI Esport]], and the acquisition of [[thamlike]] and [[Skodo]] from [[Linx Legacy Esport]]. <ref name="Jul25">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/WopaEsport/status/1940034398839033889|title=New season|date=2025-07-01|author='''WOPA Esport'''}}</ref>
*August 15th - '''WOPA Esport''' bench [[GA1De]] and sign [[Patti]]. <ref name="-ga1de">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/WopaEsport/status/1956382774912307243|title=ANNOUNCEMENT REGARDING @ga1_de|date=2025-08-15|author='''WOPA Esport'''}}</ref><ref name="+patti">{{inside source|Source=Martin}}</ref>
*September 1st - '''WOPA Esport''' release [[GA1De]] upon the expiration of his contract. <ref name="-ga1de"/>
*October 5th - '''WOPA Esport''' part ways with [[Skejs]]. <ref name="-skejs">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/WopaEsport/status/1974888516309143904|title=We bid farewell to Rasmus @Skejscs Gleerup|date=2025-10-05|author='''WOPA Esport'''}}</ref>
*October 8th - '''WOPA Esport''' sign [[kwezz]]. <ref name="+kwezz">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/WopaEsport/status/1975867028851560884|title=We’re thrilled to officially welcome 'Oliver @kwezzcsgo Rasmussen' to the team!|date=2025-10-08|author='''WOPA Esport'''}}</ref>
*October 20th - '''WOPA Esport''' suspend [[Skodo]] due to his ban by the [[Banned_Players/Other|Akros Anti-Cheat]]. <ref name="Skodo suspended">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/WopaEsport/status/1980242346005484020|title=We’re aware that our player, "Skodo", has been banned on Akros and will remain suspended until further notice|date=2025-10-20|author='''WOPA Esport'''}}</ref>
*October 22nd - '''WOPA Esport''' terminate [[Skodo]]'s contract following the confirmation of his ban from [[Banned_Players/Other|Akros Anti-Cheat]]. <ref name="-Skodo">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/WopaEsport/status/1981102098600382818|title=STATEMENT REGARDING SKODO & AKROS BAN|date=2025-10-22|author='''WOPA Esport'''}}</ref>
*November 10th - '''WOPA Esport''' transition [[b0ychild]] into a manager position. <ref name="b0ychild manager">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/WopaEsport/status/1987951687420563912|title=Our coach b0ychild will be transitioning to a new role within the organization|date=2025-11-10|author='''WOPA Esport'''}}</ref>

|content3=
*January 16th - '''WOPA Esport''' acquire [[Dengzoe]] from [[ALGO Esports]] as coach. <ref name="+dengzoe">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/STATEesport/status/2012272253942042814|title=We are more than happy to finally be able to officially announce @DengzoeCSGO as our new head coach|date=2026-01-16|author='''WOPA Esport'''}}</ref>
*February 25th - '''WOPA Esport''' part ways with [[SinK]]. <ref name="-sink">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/STATEesport/status/2026723886977733063|title=After careful consideration and reflecting on our recent performances, we have made the difficult decision to say goodbye to one of our players|date=2026-02-25|author='''WOPA Esport'''}}</ref>
*February 28th - '''WOPA Esport''' sign [[sL1m3]]. <ref name="+sL1m3">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/STATEesport/status/2027692745062552011|title=Guess what|date=2026-02-28|author='''WOPA Esport'''}}</ref>
* June 4th - [[thamlike]] moves to '''WOPA Esport''''s bench by mutual agreement. <ref name="thamlike bench">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/stateesport/status/2062526650932228605|title=@thamlikeCS has decided to step back and move to the bench due to personal reasons|date=2026-06-04|author='''WOPA Esport'''}}</ref>
* June 5th - [[Zanto]] signs a contract extension with '''WOPA Esport'''. <ref>{{cite web|url=https://x.com/STATEesport/status/2062939507821855098|title=ANNOUNCEMENT|date=2026-06-05|author='''WOPA Esport'''}}</ref>
* July 20th - [[Dengzoe]] signs a contract extension with '''WOPA Esport'''. <ref>{{cite web|url=https://x.com/STATEesport/status/2079202851742523747|title=Summerbreak is over at STATE|date=2026-07-20|author='''WOPA Esport'''}}</ref>
* July 21st - '''WOPA Esport''' sign [[Queenix]]. <ref name="+Queenix">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/STATEesport/status/2079583831384891397|title=New day|date=2026-07-21|author='''WOPA Esport'''}}</ref>
* August 20th - [[thamlike]] is acquired by [[Linx Legacy Esport]]. <ref name="-thamlike">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/LinxLegacy/status/2090468956679098656|title=THE FINAL PIECE TO A NEW LEGACY|date=2026-08-20|author=[[Linx Legacy Esport]]}}</ref>
* September 19th - '''WOPA Esport''' bench [[Patti]]. <ref name="patti bench">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/STATEesport/status/2101736901174509852|title=THANK YOU, @PattiCSGO|date=2026-09-19|author='''WOPA Esport'''}}</ref>
* September 23rd - '''WOPA Esport''' sign [[Altekz]]. <ref name="+Altekz">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/STATEesport/status/2102789786561904750|title=ANNOUNCEMENT|date=2026-09-23|author='''WOPA Esport'''}}</ref>
* September 30th - '''WOPA Esports''' part ways with [[Patti]] following the expiration of his contract. <ref name="-patti">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/PattiCSGO/status/2101723555096354852|title=My contract with @STATEesport expires at the end of the month|date=2026-09-20|author=[[Patti]]}}</ref>
}}

