'''WW TEAM''' is a [[:Category:Russia|Russian]] organization-less team founded in August 2024 by Ivan "[[StRoGo]]" Shurpatov.

==Timeline==
{{tabs dynamic
|name1=2024
|name2=2025
|name3=2026
|This=3
|content1=
* August 31st - '''WW TEAM''' is created with a roster consisting of [[StRoGo]], [[ct0m]], [[Aunkere]], [[Jerry]], and [[tried]]. <ref name="ww founded">{{inside source|source=fedos1ch}}</ref>

|content2=
* February 25th - [[shadowkek]] joins '''WW TEAM''' as the team's coach. <ref name="shadowkek">{{inside source|source=fedos1ch}}</ref>
*March 1st - [[StRoGo]] is signed by [[Aurora Gaming]]. <ref name="-strogo">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/wTeamCs/1237|title=ОФИЦИАЛЬНО: STROGO ПЕРЕХОДИТ В AURORA|trans_title=OFFICIAL: STROGO IS GOING TO AURORA|language={{flag|ru}} Russian|date=2025-03-01|author='''WW TEAM'''}}</ref>
*April 1st - '''WW TEAM''' part ways with [[Aunkere]]. <ref name="-aunkere">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/cs2valve2/1752|title=Эра WW TEAM подходит к концу — состав покинули два лидера в лице Aunkere и Jerry|trans_title=The WW TEAM era is coming to an end as two of its leaders, Aunkere and Jerry, have left the team|language={{flag|ru}} Russian|date=2025-04-01|author=[[Закулисье CS2]]}}</ref>
*April 5th - '''WW TEAM''' part ways with [[Jerry]] and add [[StRoGo]] and [[m3wsu]]. <ref name="-Jerry">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/wTeamCs/1535|title=Также сегодня у нас есть важная, но и одновременно грустная новость для всех нас: наш капитан и ключевой игрок Андрей «Jerry» Мехряков покидает нашу команду|trans_title=Today we also have important, but also sad news for all of us: our captain and key player Andrey "Jerry" Mekhryakov is leaving our team|language={{flag|ru}} Russian|date=2025-04-05|author='''WW TEAM'''}}</ref><ref name="+StRoGo">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/wTeamCs/1534|title=Сегодня в новостях не только громкие заголовки и неожиданные решафлы ЦЕЛЫХ СОСТАВОВ, но и долгожданное возвращение — Иван "StRoGo" Шурпатов снова в WW TEAM|trans_title=Today's news is not only about big headlines and unexpected reshuffles of ENTIRE SQUADS, but also about the long-awaited return of Ivan "StRoGo" Shurpatov back in the WW TEAM|language={{flag|ru}} Russian|date=2025-04-05|author='''WW TEAM'''}}</ref><ref name="+m3wsu">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/wTeamCs/1536|title=ОФИЦИАЛЬНО: Тимур «m3wsu» Коренев - новый игрок WW TEAM|trans_title=OFFICIAL: Timur "m3wsu" Korenev is the newest member of the WW TEAM|language={{flag|ru}} Russian|date=2025-04-05|author='''WW TEAM'''}}</ref>
