'''Without a Roof''' is an organization-less [[:Category:United States|American]] ''[[Counter-Strike 2]]'' team and a former ''[[Counter-Strike: Global Offensive]]'' team. It was initially formed after [[Obey Alliance]] parted ways with their team in March 2016. After more than ten years the tag was revived by a new roster led by [[Stewie2K]], with [[Brehze]] serving as the sole player shared between the two rosters.

