'''Young Ninjas''' is the academy team of [[Ninjas in Pyjamas]], a [[:Category:Sweden|Swedish]] esports organization.

==Timeline==
{{Tabs dynamic
|name1=2020
|name2=2021
|name3=2022
|name4=2023
|name5=2024
|name6=2025
|name7=2026
|This=7

|content1=
* December 23rd - '''Young Ninjas''' is formed by acquiring [[ztr]] from [[KPI Gaming]] and signing [[JAEGARN]] as the team's coach. <ref name="YN 2020">{{cite web|url=https://nip.gl/blogs/news/path-of-a-ninja-turns-into-young-ninjas-the-future-stars-of-sweden|date=2020-12-23|title=Path of a Ninja turns into Young Ninjas - the future stars of Sweden|publisher=[[Ninjas in Pyjamas]]}}</ref>

|content2=
* January 15th - '''Young Ninjas''' finalize the roster by signing [[nilo]], [[Mann3n]], [[phzy]] and [[Sapec]]. <ref name="YN 2021">{{cite web|url=https://nip.gl/blogs/news/this-is-young-ninjas|date=2021-01-15|title=This is Young Ninjas|publisher=[[Ninjas in Pyjamas]]}}</ref>
* February 2nd - [[ztr]] is moved to the [[Ninjas in Pyjamas|main team]] as a stand-in. <ref name="ztr NIP">{{cite web|url=https://nip.gl/pages/cs-go-roster-update|title=CS:GO Roster Update|date=2021-02-02|publisher=[[Ninjas in Pyjamas]]}}</ref>
* February 23rd - '''Young Ninjas''' sign [[LNZ]]. <ref name="+LNZ">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/NIPGaming/status/1364273107159158794|date=2021-02-23|title=Welcome to the team! @LNZcsgo|author=[[Ninjas in Pyjamas]]}}</ref>
* June 1st - [[Ninjas in Pyjamas]] swap [[ztr]] and [[LNZ]] on their respective squads. Additionally, they move [[JAEGARN]] to the position of a talent scout within '''Young Ninjas''', and sign [[slap]] on trial as a new coach. <ref name="LNZ NIP">{{cite web|url=https://nip.gl/pages/academy-project-is-working|title=Flashpoint success shows our academy project is working|date=2021-06-01|publisher=[[Ninjas in Pyjamas]]}}</ref><ref name="+slap (T)">{{inside source|source=slap}}</ref>
* June 4th - '''Young Ninjas''' bench [[Mann3n]] as they add [[Ro1f]] as the first winner of the "Path of a Ninja" program. <ref name="-Mann3n +Ro1f">{{cite web|url=https://nip.gl/pages/young-ninjas-welcome-ro1f|title=Young Ninjas welcome "Ro1f"|date=2021-06-04|publisher=[[Ninjas in Pyjamas]]}}</ref>
<!--*August - '''Young Ninjas''' bench [[nilo]] due to his educational commitments and reinstate [[Mann3n]] to the active roster as a stand-in.-->
* August 23rd - '''Young Ninjas''' sign [[slap]] as the head coach on a two-year contract. <ref name="+slap">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/NIPCS/status/1429839599245856772|title=Just in time for Kiev we sign @slapCS on a two-year deal as the new Head Coach of Young Ninjas!|date=2021-08-23|author=[[Ninjas in Pyjamas]]}}</ref>
* September 28th - '''Young Ninjas''' bench [[Mann3n]], release [[nilo]], and add [[debo]] on trial. Additionally, [[Sapec]] signs a two-year contract extension, keeping him tied to the organization until 2023. <ref name="YN Sep 2021">{{cite web|url=https://nip.gl/pages/young-ninjas-are-ready-for-takeoff|date=2021-09-28|title=Young Ninjas are ready for takeoff|publisher=[[Ninjas in Pyjamas]]}}</ref>
* November 17th - '''Young Ninjas''' reinstate [[LNZ]] into the starting lineup as [[es3tag]] replaces him on the [[Ninjas in Pyjamas|main team]]. <ref name="es3tag NIP">{{cite web|url=https://nip.gl/pages/welcome-es3tag|title=Welcome es3tag|date=2021-11-17|publisher=[[Ninjas in Pyjamas]]}}</ref>
* November 21st - '''Young Ninjas''' part ways with [[debo]]. <ref name="-debo">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Debocsgo/status/1462503910162186244|title=No longer playing with Young ninjas since LNZ is back with the team|date=2021-11-21|author=[[debo]]}}</ref>
* December 13th - [[phzy]] is added as a stand-in on the [[Ninjas in Pyjamas|main team]] as [[dev1ce]] goes on medical leave. <ref name="dev1ce medical">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/NIPCS/status/1470386501582209024|title=The #BLASTPremier World Final is going to be a glorious end to the 2021 season and we're proud to have made it|date=2021-12-13|author=[[Ninjas in Pyjamas]]}}</ref><ref name="dev1ce medical 2">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/jonasgundersen/status/1484245341176307715|title=We are giving @dev1ce the time he needs to come back and keep building @NIP with us|date=2022-01-20|author=[[calc]]}}</ref>

|content3=
* February 8th - '''Young Ninjas''' add [[Larva]] as a stand-in. <ref name="+larva">{{cite web|url=https://fragbite.se/cs/news/48219/young-ninjas-staller-upp-med-ny-ersattare-for-phzy-riktigt-taggad|title=Young Ninjas ställer upp med ny ersättare för phzy: "Riktigt taggad"|trans_title=Young Ninjas line up with new replacement for phzy: "Really tagged"|language={{Flag|se}} Swedish|date=2022-02-08|author=[[Sandstrxm]]|publisher=[[Fragbite]]}}</ref>
* February 23rd - [[Mann3n]] is acquired by [[Coalesce]]. <ref name="-Mann3n">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/TeamCoalesce/status/1496576764595908615|title=A new era for Coalesce begins today|date=2022-02-23|author=[[Coalesce]]}}</ref>
* March 15th - '''Young Ninjas''' part ways with [[Larva]] and reinstate [[phzy]] into the starting lineup following the end of his stand-in period in the [[Ninjas in Pyjamas|main team]]. <ref name="-Larva">{{inside source|date=2023-06-16|source=Larva}}</ref><ref name="phzy back">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/phzycs/status/1503764386690867205|title=Will play today with Young Ninjas at 17:30!|date=2022-03-15|author=[[phzy]]}}</ref>
