* August 13th - '''Young Ninjas''' loan [[phzy]] to [[Sangal Esports]]. <ref name="phzy loan"/>
* September 29th - '''Young Ninjas''' sign [[eraa]], [[nilo]] and [[abdi]], the latter as coach. <ref name="Sept 22">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/NIPCS/status/1575515981459476480|title=TIME TO WIN IT ALL|date=2022-09-29|author=[[Ninjas in Pyjamas]]}}</ref>

|content4=
