* June 1st - '''Young Ninjas''' part ways with [[LNZ]] upon the expiration of his contract. <ref name="-LNZ">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/LNZcsgo/status/1666128811912572949|title=As of the start of this month my contract has now expired with NIP and im looking to explore options|date=2023-06-06|author=[[LNZ]]}}</ref>
* July 14th - '''Young Ninjas''' part ways with [[abdi]]. <ref name="-abdi">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/AshAbdii/status/1679865936512262145|title=After an incredible journey as the coach of Young Ninjas, it is time for me to bid farewell|date=2023-07-14|author=[[abdi]]}}</ref>
* July 16th - '''Young Ninjas''' part ways with [[adamb]]. <ref name="-adamb">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/adamb_cs/status/1680626577053286401|title=After an incredible 1 year and 4 months, my journey with Young Ninjas has come to an end|date=2023-07-16|author=[[adamb]]}}</ref>
* September 11th - [[nilo]] is acquired by [[Metizport]]. <ref name="-nilo">{{cite web|url=https://www.metizport.com/en/post/a-new-era-begins-now-the-viking-ship-sets-sail-in-international-waters|title=A new era begins now - The Viking ship sets sail to international waters|date=2023-09-11|publisher=[[Metizport]]}}</ref>
