* December 8th - [[ztr]] is acquired by [[Metizport]]. <ref name="-ztr">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Metizport/status/1733184673680134439|title=New players, same goal|date=2023-12-08|author=[[Metizport]]}}</ref>
|content5=
